<title>LATVIA: OFFER PRICES SET FOR GROBINA, MADONA.</title>
<headline>OFFER PRICES SET FOR GROBINA, MADONA.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The privatisation agency has set the public offer price for fur companies Madona and Grobina at 4.14 lats and 5.48 lats respectively, it said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The securities commission yesterday said it registered the Madonia share issue of 351,981 shares at one lat nominal and the Grobina issue of 497,500 shares at one lat nominal.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
